surface":"அரி","parts":[{"text":"அரி","lemma":"ari","gloss":"chafed"}],"gloss":"chafed"},{"surface":"எருத்தின்","parts":[{"text":"எருத்து","lemma":"eruttu","gloss":"bull"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like the bull"},{"surface":"கதழும்","parts":[{"text":"கதழ்","lemma":"kataḻ","gloss":"rush"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"rushing"},{"surface":"துறைவன்","parts":[{"text":"துறை","lemma":"tuṟai","gloss":"shore"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"lord of the shore"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாராது","parts":[{"text":"வாரா","lemma":"vārā","gloss":"not coming"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"adverbial suffix"}],"gloss":"without coming"},{"surface":"அமையினும்","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"amai","gloss":"remain"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"if"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even if he remains away"},{"surface":"அமைக","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"amai","gloss":"remain"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"let him remain so"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சிறியவும்","parts":[{"text":"சிறிய","lemma":"ciṟiya","gloss":"small ones"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"smaller ones too"},{"surface":"உள","parts":[{"text":"உள","lemma":"uḷa","gloss":"exist"}],"gloss":"exist"},{"surface":"ஈண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஈண்டு","lemma":"īṇṭu","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"விலைஞர்","parts":[{"text":"விலைஞர்","lemma":"vilaiñar","gloss":"sellers"}],"gloss":"sellers'"},{"surface":"கை","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"kai","gloss":"hand"}],"gloss":"in the hands of"},{"surface":"வளையே","parts":[{"text":"வளை","lemma":"vaḷai","gloss":"bangle"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"bangles indeed"}]}],"literal":"Rain water-lily-like heron's / gaze fearing, distressed wet crab / mangrove root burrow to enter, herdsmen's / rope-chafed bull-like rushing shore-lord / without coming even if he remains, let him remain! / Smaller ones too exist here, in the sellers' hands, bangles!","translation":"Even if the lord of the shore—who rushes like a bull whose neck is chafed by the herdsmen's rope, while the wet crab, fearing the gaze of the heron that looks like a rainy-season water lily, runs to hide in the burrow among the mangrove roots—does not return, let him stay away! There are smaller bangles available here in the hands of the bangle-sellers.","modern":"மழைக்காலத்து ஆம்பல் மலரைப் போன்ற கொக்கினுடைய பார்வைக் கண்டு அஞ்சி, வருத்தமுற்ற ஈரமான நண்டு, கண்டல் மரத்தின் வேர்களிலுள்ள வளைக்குள் சென்று மறைவதற்குக் கரையும்; ஆயர்களின் கயிற்றினால் கழுத்து அறுபட்ட எருது விரைந்து ஓடுவதைப் போலத் தேரில் விரைந்து வரும் துறைவன், நம்மிடம் வராமல் அங்கேயே தங்கிவிட்டாலும் தங்கட்டும். அவனால் மெலிந்த உன்னுடைய கைகளுக்குப் பொருந்தக்கூடிய சிறிய வளையல்களும் இங்கே வளையல் விற்போரின் கைகளில் இருக்கின்றனவே!","explanation":"This poem is set in the coastal landscape (neytal tiṇai). The speaker is the heroine's friend (tōḻi), addressing either the heroine or speaking within earshot of the hero who has delayed his marriage. The heroine has grown thin with grief over the hero's absence, causing her bangles to slip off her wrists. The friend sarcastically remarks that even if the lord of the shore does not return, they do not need to worry, because smaller bangles are available from the local merchants to fit her shrunken wrists. The image of the wet crab fleeing from the heron into the mangrove roots mirrors the heroine's vulnerability and her search for safety. The comparison of the rushing hero to a bull chafed by a rope suggests his restless haste, yet his failure to commit to marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,2.3],[2.3,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,3.4],[3.4,4.6],[4.6,4.9],[4.9,5.3],[5.3,5.6],[5.6,6.4],[6.41,6.5],[6.5,6.8],[6.8,7.3],[7.3,7.3],[7.3,7.3],[7.3,7.3],[7.3,10.0],[10.0,10.4],[10.4,11.1],[11.1,11.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.87],[0.87,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,2.6],[2.6,2.7],[2.7,3.2],[3.2,3.9],[3.9,5.2],[5.2,5.6],[5.6,6.1],[6.1,6.4],[6.4,7.2],[7.21,7.3],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,8.2],[8.2,8.2],[8.2,8.2],[8.2,8.2],[8.2,11.3],[11.3,11.6],[11.6,12.5],[12.5,12.8]]},"sync":[[["மாரி","rain"]],[["ஆம்பல்","water lily"]],[["ஆம்பல்","water lily"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["கொக்கின்","of the heron"]],[["பார்வல்","gaze"]],[["அஞ்சிய","feared"]],[["பருவரல்","distressed"]],[["ஈர்","wet"],["ஞெண்டு","crab"]],[["கண்டல்","mangrove"]],[["வேர்","root"],["அளை","burrow"]],[["செலீஇயர்","in order to enter"]],[["அண்டர்","herdsmen's"]],[["கயிறு","rope"],["அரி","chafed"]],[["எருத்தின்","like the bull"]],[["கதழும்","rushing"]],[["துறைவன்","lord of the shore"]],[["வாராது","without coming"]],[["வாராது","without coming"],["அமையினும்","even if he remains away"]],[["அமைக","let him remain so"]],[["சிறியவும்","smaller ones too"]],[["உள","exist"],["ஈண்டு","here"]],[["விலைஞர்","sellers'"],["கை","in the hands of"]],[["வளையே","bangles indeed"]]]}